TLS Handshake Flow
                    TLS HANDSHAKE

Client                                      Server
  │                                           │
  │ ----------- ClientHello ----------------> │
  │                                           │
  │ <----------- ServerHello ---------------- │
  │                                           │
  │ <-------- EncryptedExtensions ----------- │
  │ <------------- Certificate ------------- │
  │ <---------- CertificateVerify ---------- │
  │ <--------------- Finished -------------- │
  │                                           │
  │ -------------- Finished ---------------> │
  │                                           │
  │ <------ Encrypted Application Data ----> │
  │                                           │
